      },
      "message": "build(process): merge-ready skill in the repo, deterministic merge planner, collaborator rule\n\n- .claude/skills/merge-ready/SKILL.md: the maintainer's merge-ready procedure on\n  `cargo xtask merge-plan`, so every agent and fork runs the same steps.\n- merge-plan: every ordering choice is a named total order ending in the PR\n  number; the plan prints the base sha and each head sha; `--json`; the\n  plan renderer moves to merge_plan_out.rs.\n- Any collaborator's review and merge-ready label count and any collaborator\n  may merge (maintainer, 2026-11-12); replaces the owner-only rule.\n- PROCESS_VERSION 32.\n\nFixes #1320\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
